   140                              <1> breakRoutine:
   141                              <1> ;This subroutine is called by ^C
   142                              <1> ;Prompts the user for what they want to do.
   143                              <1> ;Preserve registers across call.
   144                              <1> ;
   145                              <1> ;We always return IRETQ which means we always execute the 
   146                              <1> ; function code that we return to DOS in eax. Unless we wish
